        "original_id": "7de03b53-f457-597a-861f-a8c93faf1917",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Jessica Jones, The Defenders\n- People: Melissa Rosenberg, Douglas Petrie, Marco Ramirez\n- Companies: Netflix, Marvel Comics\n- Systems: Marvel Cinematic Universe\n- Concepts: continuity, crossover miniseries, superhero team\n\nFacts:\n- Marvel's Jessica Jones, also called Jessica Jones, is an American web television series created for Netflix by Melissa Rosenberg and based on the Marvel Comics character Jessica Jones.\n- Jessica Jones is set in the Marvel Cinematic Universe and shares continuity with the franchise's films.\n- Jessica Jones is the second in a series of shows that lead to The Defenders crossover miniseries.\n- Marvel's The Defenders, also called The Defenders, is an American web television miniseries created for Netflix by Douglas Petrie and Marco Ramirez.\n- The Defenders is based on the Marvel Comics characters Daredevil, Jessica Jones, Luke Cage, and Iron Fist, who form the superhero team called the Defenders.",
